flowchart TD
  U[User submits report/block] --> R[reports table]
  R --> C[moderation_cases table]
  C --> Q{Admin review}
  Q -->|No action| CLOSE[Case closed]
  Q -->|Warn| WARN[audit_logs: warning]
  Q -->|Ban| BAN[users_profile.is_banned=true]
  BAN --> LOG[audit_logs: ban action]

  MSG[New message] --> RULE{keyword/throttle check}
  RULE -->|pass| DELIVER[Store message]
  RULE -->|flag| FLAG[Create moderation case]
